  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut the sweet potato and zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c188161f3bba704a1cdd7c/step-d500f77b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, drain and rinse the lentils. Finely chop the garlic. Roughly chop the parsley. Thinly slice the spring onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c188161f3bba704a1cdd7c/step-fb342839.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, roughly mash the black beans. Add the garlic, parsley, spring onion, dukkah, egg, vegetable stock pot, plain flour and fine breadcrumbs. Crumble in 1/2 the fetta cubes. Season, then mix well. Using damp hands, roll the mixture into small balls (three per person). Transfer to a plate and refrigerate for 5 minutes.\n• TIP: Chilling the patties helps them firm up!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c188161f3bba704a1cdd7c/step-a255d389.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over a medium-high heat. When the oil is hot, place a few black bean balls in the pan and flatten with a spatula until 1cm-thick. Cook until golden and cooked through, 2-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!). Transfer to a plate lined with paper towel. Repeat with the remaining balls.\n• TIP: Add extra oil if needed to prevent the patties from sticking to the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c188161f3bba704a1cdd7c/step-8139abf4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the patties are cooking, combine the mixed salad leaves, walnuts and slightly cooled roasted veggies in a large bowl. Add the golden goddess dressing and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c188161f3bba704a1cdd7c/step-2a299aa7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the black bean, fetta and dukkah patties and roast veggie, rocket and walnut salad between plates. Crumble the remaining fetta over the salad. Serve with the dill & parsley mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c188161f3bba704a1cdd7c/step-f31e498c.jpg"
    }
  ]
